The [[Shortbow]] is a [[Weapon]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s, at common rarity. It has low damage, but also costs relatively low stamina, and mainly is useful to craft into the [[Tusk Poker]], [[Fortuna's Hope]], [[Belladonna's Shade]], or [[Squirrel Archer]].
